Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.80,Short,,0,0,0,,Your nose starts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.60,Short,,0,0,0,,to tickle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.10,Short,,0,0,0,,your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.02,Short,,0,0,0,,squeeze shut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:03.58,Short,,0,0,0,,and your whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.82,Short,,0,0,0,,body launches whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.60,Short,,0,0,0,,was in there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.00,Short,,0,0,0,,across the room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:07.74,Short,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:08.30,Short,,0,0,0,,when dust
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.44,Short,,0,0,0,,or germs touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.48,Short,,0,0,0,,the nerves inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.36,Short,,0,0,0,,your nose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.28,Short,,0,0,0,,your brain fires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:12.88,Short,,0,0,0,,a reflex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:13.46,Short,,0,0,0,,to blast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:14.16,Short,,0,0,0,,them out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:14.64,Short,,0,0,0,,and the spray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.46,Short,,0,0,0,,can travel up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.94,Short,,0,0,0,,to 26 feet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:17.44,Short,,0,0,0,,But for about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:17.88,Short,,0,0,0,,one in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.66,Short,,0,0,0,,four people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.16,Short,,0,0,0,,just stepping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.16,Short,,0,0,0,,into bright sunlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:20.60,Short,,0,0,0,,can make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.62,Short,,0,0,0,,them sneeze
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.88,Short,,0,0,0,,because scientists think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.50,Short,,0,0,0,,the signals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.32,Short,,0,0,0,,from their eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:24.92,Short,,0,0,0,,get crossed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:25.64,Short,,0,0,0,,with the nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:26.90,Short,,0,0,0,,in their nose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:27.38,Short,,0,0,0,,And you should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:27.98,Short,,0,0,0,,never hold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:28.42,Short,,0,0,0,,one in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.86,Short,,0,0,0,,One man pinched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:30.30,Short,,0,0,0,,his nose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:30.84,Short,,0,0,0,,and closed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:31.36,Short,,0,0,0,,his mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:31.82,Short,,0,0,0,,to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:32.72,Short,,0,0,0,,a sneeze
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.16,Short,,0,0,0,,and the pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:33.96,Short,,0,0,0,,tore a hole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:34.50,Short,,0,0,0,,in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.34,Short,,0,0,0,,of his throat
